\dMs. Kouno! Are you purposefully trying to get us all\ncurious?\d%K%P
「老师～，\n别做出这种让人想要一探究竟的发言啦～」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Is that true, Sasaki?\d%K%P
「…那是真的吗？佐佐木」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dNo mistaking it. I have heard all this from Mr. Uesaka,\nwho resides at Room #1. That old gentleman is called Mr.\nRetired by the other inhabitants, and is the most\nrespected member of their community.\d%K%P
「不会错的。\n是闲聊的时候，从一号室的上坂氏那里得来的情报。\n那位老人，被别的住人称呼为老爷子，拥有比较深厚的人望…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dSince when are you on friendly terms with these people?\d%K%P
「你啊，什么时候和那边住户的关系这么好了？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dTh-There was no other way. I had to somehow insinuate\nmyself into their community to make sure the information\nabout Mr. Yoshimura I relay to you is always up to date.\d%K%P
「那、那是不得已而为之。\n为了得到芳村先生的详细情报，\n无论如何也必须融入他们的生活…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHm, I feel like you've become awfully skilled at making\nexcuses...\d%K%P
「怪不得我感觉你最近口才越来越好了…」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dNever in my wildest dreams would I do that! My sole\npurpose is to always be able to convey information I can\nconfirm to be accurate with my own eyes and ears so as not\nto misinform you, Milady!\d%K%P
「不不怎么会呢。\n我只是全力的完成着将自己所见、自己所闻的全部\n一字不差地传达给大小姐的工作…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Well, whatever. Continue. It all happened during that\ntyphoon, right? When I got stuck in Kansai.\d%K%P
「………嘛算了，继续吧。\n那天，是有台风的那一天吧？\n我被留在了关西」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dYes. According to my information, all inhabitants of the\nTerrace House Hinosaka were away that day due to personal\nbusiness, except for Ms. Hinosaka herself.\d%K%P
「是的，那天的Terrace House阳之坂，\n所有的居民都因为偶然而不在房子里。\n…除了阳坂小姐以外」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dShe was all alone...? During that typhoon...?\d%K%P
「只有一个人…？\n在那台风之中…？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dOn top of it, East Hagimori seems to have suffered a\nblackout during the evening hours and lacked electricity\nfor the whole night. I can only imagine how anxious a girl\nher age must have been in that situation.\d%K%P
「而且，似乎那一天的东萩守一带，\n深夜是一直处于停电状态。\n那份恐惧恐怕不是常人能够体会的吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dBut at that moment, Mr. Yoshimura, who was supposed to be\non his way to Gifu for a vacation, suddenly realized the\npossible precariousness of the matter, and made a quick\ndecision to turn around.\d%K%P
「在那时候…芳村先生直到前天为止应该回到了岐阜，\n可是察觉到阳坂小姐的危险后立即返程了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWh-What is that supposed to mean?! Are you saying I\nfailed to notice how Toko was in trouble? That I left her\nall alone, completely oblivious to her anxiety and fear?!\d%K%P
「什、什么啊！\n那就是说我把小都子置于危险而不顾吗？\n没有察觉到她的恐惧而把她扔在一边了吗！？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI-I didn't mean to imply anything of the sort. I am\nmerely reporting the facts. In any case, Ms. Hinosaka and\nMr. Yoshimura spent the night together with no electricity\nduring that typhoon, and...\d%K%P
「不、不，绝不是这样…我只是在报告…\n那一天，阳坂小姐和芳村先生在昏暗的风暴中，\n孤男寡女过了一夜，于是…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAaaaah! Not another word! I don't want to hear it!\d%K%P
「啊啊啊不要再说下去了！别说了」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dA-As you wish.\d%K%P
「遵、遵命」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dN-No way... Toko and that man spent the night together?\nWith that completely hopeless scum of the earth? I...\nI...\d%K%P
「怎、怎么这样…小都子和那个男人在深夜中两人独处…\n要是以后对人生绝望过上自我堕落的生活可怎么办…」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dIt is not clear exactly what happened that night, but\never since then, Ms. Hinosaka and Mr. Yoshimura seem to\nhave grown closer. Almost like best buds, to borrow the\nwords of the locals.\d%K%P
「那晚发生了什么虽然还不明白，不过至少，\n以那一天为分界线，阳坂小姐和芳村先生的关系变得非常好了。\n按照周围人评价，他们的关系简直是突飞猛进」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Grrrrrr.\d%K%P
「…（焦躁不安）」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dOne of the inhabitants, who shall remain unnamed, gave me\nthese mysterious words: \dLaid-off, 'tis no green apple,\nbut a forbidden, unripe fruit.\d\d%K%P
「一位油腔滑调的住户曾说过\n『失业的，那可不是青苹果哟。而是禁断的青涩果实』\n这样的迷之话语…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dCut it out with the dirty jokes, okay?!\d%K%P
「那种粗俗的笑话就免了！」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI-I was merely reporting what I have heard, that is\nall...\d%K%P
「所、所以说我只是将我知道的报告给您…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThat's the suspension bridge effect, and nothing else!\nToko has been tricked by that despicable man!\d%K%P
「那状况肯定只是吊桥效果导致的！\n小都子被欺骗了啊！」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dSo you do admit that those two are on quite friendly\nterms right now?\d%K%P
「也就是说，您现在承认他们两人的关系变好了？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dSasaki, whose side are... Stop the car!\d%K%P
「佐佐木，你到底站在哪边………快停下！」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dR-Right away!\d%K%P
「好、好的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dM-Mitoko, please stop. I can't breathe anymore.\d%K%P
「美、美都子，差不多停下吧。\n我快不能呼吸了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're pathetic, Osamu! We haven't even been running for\nfive minutes.\d%K%P
「真是丢脸啊～理君。\n只不过跑了大概５分钟的路程嘛」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI know what you're going to say, so let me just point out\nin advance that I'm not that young anymore, all right?\d%K%P
「为了以防万一我就先说了，\n我已经『不是那么』年轻了…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat sounds like nothing more than a sad excuse.\d%K%P
「…虽然你先说了，不过我感觉这只是很丢脸的借口啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAnyway, let me rest for just a little while. If this\nkeeps up, I won't even be able to carry your bags.\d%K%P
「总之让我休息下。\n这样下去的话，在把东西拿回去之前体力就耗尽了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dGeez, you really are an inconvenient accessory. Well,\nwhatever, let's go sit on that bench then.\d%K%P
「真是～各种不顺手啊。\n先到那边的长椅上休息下吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dO-Okay... Do you want me to go buy you some juice?\d%K%P
「嗯、嗯…\n那，我去买果汁来吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThat's a waste of money. I brought my tea, so let's drink\nthat together.\d%K%P
「那样多浪费啊。\n我带茶水了，一起喝吧」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'm sorry for troubling you with everything.\d%K%P
「…总是麻烦你了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHow long are you planning to keep on speaking like a\ngrandpa?\d%K%P
「不要用像生病父亲一样的口气说话啦」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dDon't call me that!!\d%K%P
「说好了不提这件事的吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAhahaha... Anyway, let's go sit on one of those benches,\nOsamu!\d%K%P
「啊哈哈哈…来来，理君，这边这边」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWh-When are you planning to let go of my hand, by the\nway?\d%K%P
「所、所以说…差不多可以把手放开了吧…」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Grrrrrr.\d%K%P
「…（焦躁不安）」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dSee, that's what I was talking about.\d%K%P
「看吧，就像那样的状态」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dQuiet, you!\d%K%P
「闭嘴！」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dM-My apologies.\d%K%P
「实、实在是非常抱歉」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI let my guard down... I completely underestimated that\nman. I shouldn't have gotten all emotional and helped him.\nStupid of me.\d%K%P
「是我太愚蠢了…太小看那个男人了。\n我不应该同情他、而且还帮他一把的」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI believe that would be one of your good traits, Milady.\d%K%P
「不过我认为那就是大小姐的优点」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dBut my eyes have finally been opened. He might be the\nmost pathetic and incapable person on the face of the\nearth, a man who latches on to any woman he meets... but\nthat in itself makes him our enemy!\d%K%P
「托你的福我清醒了…不过不管他多么悲惨，\n哪怕没有生活能力也好，被女的甩了也好，\n不，就因为这样，那男人才是敌人」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dI-Is that so...?\d%K%P
「是、是吗」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHe used his nefarious means to earn Toko's trust, and now\nhe's acting like a leech and sucking her dry... sucking\nher... Oh my god!!\d%K%P
「巧妙地获得了小都子的信赖后像蛀虫般寄生在她身上，\n然后吸、吸取着甜蜜的…成何体统！」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dWhat on earth were you imagining there?\d%K%P
「您到底想象了什么东西啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI'm done showing mercy! If I have to, I'll use the entire\npower of the Sawashima Group to eliminate him from Toko's\nside!\d%K%P
「我已经不会手下留情了。\n哪怕使用泽嶋家的全部力量，\n这次也一定要让他从小都子身边彻底消失！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...Anyway, it might be a little loud for a while, but I\nhope you understand.\d%K%P
「…就是这样了，\n我想暂时可能会变得吵闹起来，不好意思了啊～？」%K%P
%LCSasaki
%LC佐佐木
\dIs that how you use the Sawashima Group's \dentire power,\d\nMilady?\d%K%P
「这就是使用了泽嶋家的全部力量的地下工作吗，大小姐…」%K%P
Sasaki's exasperated whisper was drowned out by the noise\nof construction tools banging against solid ground.%K%P
佐佐木先生呆然的叹息\n被巨大的掘削声覆盖消失了。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou're gonna build a whole separate building for your\nbath in your garden? That's so cool!\d%K%P
「哎～，要在庭院建澡堂啊！\n真好啊，大浴室」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dIt feels like it's gonna be there just to torture us.\d%K%P
「总感觉不爽啊…」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWe don't even have a bath.\d%K%P
「我们这边根本就不存在浴室什么的」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dYou can't be serious...\d%K%P
「真是的放过我吧…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI'm so sleepy...\d%K%P
「好困…」%K%P
The construction work that suddenly started in the early\nhours of the morning was nothing short of torture for me\nafter my part-time job's night shift.%K%P
这天亮时突然开始的隔壁施工，\n对于彻夜打工的我来说简直和拷问没什么两样。%K%P
An actual excavator was digging a hole in between our\nhouse and Sawashima's, right next to my window.%K%P
毕竟，在我们公寓的交界线附近，\n连挖掘机都已经出动，对着庭院开工了。%K%P
If the noise wasn't bad enough, the vibrations from the\nconstruction traveled through the ground all the way to\nour house, making it tremble like it was about to fall\napart. I could barely even hear my own voice inside.%K%P
不只是噪音，还有非常夸张的震动，\n这本可以轻易听到隔壁声音的公寓，\n已经处于连听到自己的声音都十分困难的状态了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYou can use it any time you want after it's done, 24/7 if\nyou want!\d%K%P
「完成的话小都子你每天也都可以用哦。\n２４小时随时都可以使用的哦？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dR-Really?! Ah, but I feel like it'd be rude to go that\nfar.\d%K%P
「可、可以吗！？\n啊…但是这么做的话果然是很厚脸皮的吧」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhat are you talking about? The cost doesn't change for\nme no matter how many times someone uses it. Besides, it's\na waste of money to keep on paying for the public bath,\ndon't you think?\d%K%P
「说什么～呢。\n那种东西不管有多少人进去花费也不会变的。\n再说去公共澡堂的话很浪费钱的吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「姫绪姐…」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dAh, such wondrous news. The older I get, the harder it\nbecomes to travel all that distance to our public bath.\d%K%P
「这真是不错啊。\n最近因为年纪大了去浴场的路途也很辛苦呢」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dGoing outside has been kinda tough for me as well lately,\nso having a bath nearby is like a total lifesaver.\nSeriously!\d%K%P
「我最近也真是懒得外出了。\n附近有澡堂真是太好了！」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dIndeed, one would expect no less from the Sawashima. I\nwasn't mistaken to keep an eye on you, princess.\d%K%P
「真不愧是泽嶋家，出手就是不同凡响。\n你一直以来都是警戒…不，关注这件事的啊，公主！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhat are these buffoons talking about?\d%K%P
「这里的家伙们怎么能说出这么不要脸的话」%K%P
Ms. Sawashima's ice cold comment was also drowned out by\nthe noise.%K%P
泽嶋小姐那无表情的伪装下透露出来的冷淡叹息，\n果然也是被巨大的掘削声音掩盖了。%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dSo... How long are you planning to torture us with this\ncrap?\d%K%P
「先不管那些，\n这吵闹的情况要持续到什么时候？」%K%P
Ms. Kaya, who lived in Room #5, was even closer to the\nconstruction site than me, which made her indignation\nquite justified.%K%P
距离工事现场最近的五号室的夏夜\n当然受到了最大的影响，她显得有些不高兴。%K%P
...Also, I wish she didn't go outside dressed like that.%K%P
…不管怎样，真希望她不要这么打扮着出门啊。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dThe construction should be done in a month or so. I'm\nusing my group's services, after all.\d%K%P
「工程大概只要一个月就能结束了哦。\n毕竟是倾尽我们公司全力所做的工程」%K%P
Besides the excavator, I could also see a dump truck, a\ncement truck, and even what seemed like a half-assembled\ncrane beyond the fence.%K%P
不仅有挖掘机、翻斗车和卡车、混凝土车，\n就连起重机也出现在旁边的院子里了。%K%P
I had no idea what they'd be using that for, but it all\nlooked pretty incredible.%K%P
虽然不明白起重机的实际用途，\n总之是好厉害的重型机械啊。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dBut you see, because I made them hurry so much, I kinda\nended up unable to live in this house for a while.\d%K%P
「不过啊，为了尽早完成工期，我们做得过度了些，\n所以直到工事完成之前都不能进入家里了」%K%P
%LCKihee
%LC喜兵卫
\dThat, um, certainly seems to be the case.\d%K%P
「那是…看来的确是这样啊」%K%P
Her garden was filled with so many things one could hardly\nsqueeze through the gates, much less reach the actual\nhouse.%K%P
不要说家中了，就连到达玄关也做不到。\n本来就是处于连门都无法打开的状态。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIs that so? That sounds like a pain. So where are you\nplanning to live until the construction's over?\d%K%P
「这样啊，真不容易。\n那，直到工事结束为止住的地方怎么解决呢？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHmm, to tell you the truth, I don't know. I can't commute\nto the university from my home in Nagoya, after all. You\ncould say I'm in a bit of a pickle right now.\d%K%P
「唔～嗯，实话说我现在很为难呢。\n又不能从老家那里去上学，该怎么办呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI see...\d%K%P
「这样啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI wish there was a place nearby where I could stay... At\nleast until the worst of the construction is taken care\nof.\d%K%P
「只在工事期间也好，\n在这附近有没有可以住的地方呢…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI fail to see how someone as rich as her could have that\nproblem.\d%K%P
「区区居住的地方，就让泽嶋家的公主如此为难吗？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYeah, like she couldn't just live in hotel or something.\d%K%P
「明明只要住在宾馆之类的地方就完全没问题了」%K%P
Those two were standing right next to me, so I could hear\nthem at least.%K%P
这两人无法释然的对话，\n立即都被跟前杵着的我听到了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI guess I should visit some local estate agents and see\nwhat they have to offer. Ahh, what a pain. I wish there\nwas a kind soul who...\d%K%P
「没办法了，拜托这附近的房产中介\n来找找看吧…啊啊真是为难呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dU-Um...\d%K%P
「那、那个啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHm?\d%K%P
「嗯？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI get the feeling it might be too cramped and ancient for\nyou, but if that's not a problem, I...\d%K%P
「对姬绪姐来说，可能是既狭小又古旧，\n不怎么舒服的地方…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOh, not a problem at all! If anything, I've always wanted\nto try living at a historic residence with the smell of\nwood permeating the place!\d%K%P
「完全不用在意那些事啦！\n不如说这是木质的香气？\n我一直想试着住在这样的地方！」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\d...That sounded almost like a rehearsed line.\d%K%P
「…感觉就像准备好的回答一样哦」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dYou sure that \dalmost\d was needed there?\d%K%P
「『像』是不需要的吧？」%K%P
%LCKaya
%LC夏夜
\dActually, her answer kinda preceded the offer, but\nneither seem to be aware of that.\d%K%P
