It seemed that the relatively strong beer from her\nlocality that was popular a decade or so ago wasn't to Ms.\nSawashima's liking.%K%P
以前很流行，而现在稍有浓厚的当地啤酒，\n似乎不合泽嶋小姐的口味。%K%P
Still, I couldn't have asked for a better excuse to start\na conversation with her. I knew she would bite the moment\nI brought up hometowns.%K%P
话说回来，作为谈话的开始，\n这可能是个有效的话题啊。\n因为无论如何，她绝对会回应的。%K%P
