%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dFor someone who only plays games and lifts weights, you\nsure know your stuff.\d%K%P
「你知道的还真是详细啊，小熊。\n明明平时除了筋肉锻炼和游戏就什么都不做的」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dN-No, wait a second. It's true that Michihama is hiding\ntheir relationship with Mitsumaru, but...\d%K%P
「不、不，请等一下啊。\n道浜虽然的确把与三丸的关系隐瞒得很好…」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...You seem to know more than you're telling us. Okay,\nI'll see what's going on with Michihama Trading in more\ndetail.\d%K%P
「…怎么感觉又知道了些多余的东西啊。\n知道啦，我试试追踪一下道浜商事最近的动向」%K%P
Ms. Sawashima definitely implied that Michihama and\nMitsumaru were sharing profits. In fact, I found evidence\nof that myself.%K%P
按她的话来说…\n不，就算从我调查的事实看来，\n道浜商事明显给三丸房地产供给过利润。%K%P
And to quite an exaggerated extent, to tell the truth,\nprobably because it was unlikely their relationship would\never surface.%K%P
和其他明显的集团企业不同，\n因为没有表现出来，反而规模应该很大。%K%P
If anything, I would have been expecting it to be the\ncenter of the investigation.%K%P
巧妙的隐蔽、逃过这次算得上网罗搜查的可能性也几乎…%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\d...The hell is this?\d%K%P
「………这是什么啊？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dD-Did you find out something?\d%K%P
「知、知道什么了吗？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI guess I did, you could say. ...I found out who your\nsource was, at least.\d%K%P
「要说知道的话也算知道了吧？\n…告诉你这个情报的人」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dEh?\d%K%P
「哎？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dI thought she hated you. When did you two grow that\nclose?\d%K%P
「明明看上去关系那么差劲…\n什么时候牵扯到一起去了啊，你们两个」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dWhat? What are you talking about?\d%K%P
「什么什么？\n怎么回事？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dLook, this is an article from yesterday.\d%K%P
「就是这个…昨天的新闻」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
In the new window that Mr. Kumazaki opened, I could make\nout a set of tiny letters reading \dMichihama Trading.\d%K%P
在熊崎先生新打开的画面里，\n这次确实登载着『道浜商事』这小小的文字。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHm, let me see... Wait, what? Isn't that Himeo's place?\d%K%P
「呃，怎么回事……这什么啊？\n是公主的玩笑吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHaha...\d%K%P
「哈哈…」%K%P
\dSawashima Group Partners with Three New Real Estate\nAgencies\d%K%P
『泽嶋房地产为了业务扩张而与三家公司合作』%K%P
\dOn August 31, the Sawashima Group, headquartered in Aichi\nPrefecture, announced that they will be incorporating the\nfollowing three companies as subsidiaries...\d%K%P
『泽嶋房地产（总公司·爱知县）在３１日发表了消息，\n为了房地产事业的业务扩张，\n将新的三家公司资本和业务提携后并入子公司』%K%P
\dShikijo Corporation (Kanagawa Prefecture), Kubota\nEngineering (Tokyo City), and Michihama Trading (Tokyo\nCity).\d%K%P
『被提携的三家公司有敷城集团（神奈川县）、\n窪田土木（东京）、道浜商事（东京）…』%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAhahahaha... Yes...!\d%K%P
「啊哈哈哈哈…太好了」%K%P
That was my proposition #5.%K%P
这是、方案５啊…%K%P
The same devil's deal that I was afraid to even put on my\npresentation.%K%P
在提案书的最后一页所记载，\n都没法作为规划发表的、恶魔的交易。%K%P
It meant unconditionally yielding to Mitsumaru's rival and\nthe provocateur of the current investigation, the\nSawashima Group, while having them keep us afloat as a\npart of themselves.%K%P
向三丸的宿敌——\n这次搜查的发起人的泽嶋房地产全面投降，\n只将公司的生命救下来，这种禁断的作战%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dHey, what does this even mean? What's up with this\ncompany you worked for?\d%K%P
「呐，这是什么意思？\n失业者之前的公司怎么样了？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dBasically, the princess's dad bought it out, and now he\ncan do whatever he wants with the place.\d%K%P
「也就是说，公主父亲的公司那边输入资金和职员，\n那家公司被其自由自在地操纵了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThank goodness... I can't believe it really worked out. I\nguess you should never underestimate the passion of\nlifelong employees.\d%K%P
「太好了…真的是太好了。\n果然，元老的力量不是闹着玩的…」%K%P
They somehow managed to get the president on their side in\nthe rebellion against Mitsumaru. And in such a short time,\ntoo.%K%P
如此短的时间，而且敌人还是三丸那一方，\n但是社长终于下了决断。%K%P
It was doubtlessly the result of Chief Hiragi's ability,\nas well as the trust he had built up with the other\nemployees over the years.%K%P
平木科长不懈努力所蓄积的行动力和人脉，\n终于有了用武之地。%K%P
In any case, this meant that Michihama Trading would\nsurvive.%K%P
不管怎样，这样道浜商事总算是活下来了。%K%P
I had no way of telling whether anything I did really\nhelped them or not, but at least they managed to avoid the\nworst possible outcome.%K%P
虽然不知道我的努力有没有起到作用，\n不过总算是避免了最坏的结果。%K%P
And it was all thanks to a certain grumpy girl from\nyesterday.%K%P
这，都是多亏了昨晚心情那么差的她。%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dSo, is that a good thing? I don't get it.\d%K%P
「那，这是好事么？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dWell, that depends on the situation.\d%K%P
「嘛，那要看时间和场合了」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dFor example?\d%K%P
「比如说？」%K%P
%LCYoshinori
%LC吉则
\dHmm... I guess it would be a pretty good deal for anyone\ninto being kept on the leash of an attractive yet short-\ntempered queen who has a particular fondness for her\nwhip.\d%K%P
「比如说…对于极其喜欢被虽是美人但冷血又性急的公主抽鞭子的人来说，\n这是垂涎三尺的绝好条件吧」%K%P
%LCBuntarou
%LC文太郎
\dI see... That definitely sounds like something Laid-off\nwould love.\d%K%P
「原来如此…简直就像失业的一样…？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAll right, it's finished! Well then, make some space on\nthe table!\d%K%P
「好～终于完成了～！\n来，快收拾一下桌子～」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dOkay!\d%K%P
「好～的！」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWell, what do you think...? I can't guarantee the taste,\nbut it looks nice at least!\d%K%P
「你看，怎么样呢…？\n口味先不论，看上去应该是很好吃的吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI feel like I've heard that before.\d%K%P
「等下，我怎么感觉最近\n好像有完全一样的状况发生啊？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dHahaha, but I wonder if it's really the same.\d%K%P
「呵呵呵，这次又怎么样呢？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat about the length of the chives?\d%K%P
「韭菜的长度是？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dAll equal.\d%K%P
「均等」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dWhat did you do with the liver?\d%K%P
「猪肝如何处理？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dLet out the blood and seasoned it.\d%K%P
「去血和除味」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAnd after that?\d%K%P
「然后呢？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dI covered it with potato starch, and... uh...\d%K%P
「然后涂满片栗粉…呃」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\d...I'm sorry. I ended up frying it together with the\nchives.\d%K%P
「…抱歉。\n又和韭菜一起炒了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHahh... Well, that's not the end of the world. It\ndefinitely earns you a pass, at least.\d%K%P
「呼，算了，这种程度的话还好啦。\n制作方法及格了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dYes! I passed on my first try! Now I can be your wife.\d%K%P
「成功了～！一次就ＯＫ了～！\n这样不管什么时候当小都子的新娘都没问题了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou sure? I like to be the one in control.\d%K%P
「我的大男子主义可是非常严重的哦，这样可以吗？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dOf course. I'm the type who likes to serve, didn't you\nknow?\d%K%P
「没关系没关系，我可是十分有献身精神的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI wonder about that... But we're getting ahead of\nourselves. We still have to check the taste.\d%K%P
「总感觉…呃，还不能掉以轻心哦。\n那接下来就是口味如何了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dSure, sure... Anyway, shall we get started? Put your\nhands together, and--\d%K%P
「好好…那，一起开动吧？\n双手合十～」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, wait a second.\d%K%P
「啊～，稍等一下」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬绪
\dWhat's wrong, Toko? I already brought the tea.\d%K%P
「怎么了小都子？\n喝水的话在这边哦」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI'll go call Osamu.\d%K%P
「我去叫理君过来」%K%P
