%LC美都子
\dAh, by the way, Osamu... one of those dishes was made by\nHimeo. Do you think you can guess which?\d%K%P
「啊，理君，其实呢，这些菜里有一份\n是姬绪姐做的哦。能找到是哪一个吗？」%K%P
